  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Weaker runes tend to be smaller, so learning how to write in the margins lets you cram something in there.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Ability to inscribe Greater runes</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you inscribe runes for the day, you may inscribe two equipment runes on a single item, but if and only if one of those runes is a Least rune and the other rune is at least one power level lower than the greatest power level you can inscribe. You can only \"double inscribe\" a single item in this fashion each day.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/runesmithing-feats#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
